<h1>Verify your email</h1>
<p>Hello <%= @user.first_name %>,</p>
<p>Your <%= @purpose.humanize.downcase %> verification code is:</p>
<p style="font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 8px"><%= @code %></p>
<p>This code expires in 5 minutes. If you did not request it, you can ignore this email.</p>
